{"id":"23ed499f8d7c6524","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-conservativity-proof.md","title":"保守性与模型扩张判据","display":"df-conservativity-proof — 保守性与模型扩张判据","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-conservativity-proof","aliases":["91-df-conservativity-proof","91-df-conservative-proof","91-df-conservativity-argument"],"display":"df-conservativity-proof — 保守性与模型扩张判据","depends_on":["[[91-df-conservative-truth]]","[[91-df-structure]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-conservativity-proof"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-conservativity-proof</span><span>91-df-conservative-proof</span><span>91-df-conservativity-argument</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-conservativity-proof — 保守性与模型扩张判据"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4a1d989a5f615933\" href=\"?note=4a1d989a5f615933\" title=\"91-df-conservative-truth\">91-df-conservative-truth</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c8e718c83a9cc331\" href=\"?note=c8e718c83a9cc331\" title=\"91-df-structure\">91-df-structure</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-conservativity-proof-—-保守性与模型扩张判据-$\\mathrm{ConsProof}$\">df-conservativity-proof — 保守性与模型扩张判据 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ConsProof}\">\\(\\mathrm{ConsProof}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq U\">\\(S\\subseteq U\\)</span> (理论扩张)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_0=\\operatorname{Lang}(S)\\subseteq\\mathcal L_U=\\operatorname{Lang}(U)\">\\(\\mathcal L_0=\\operatorname{Lang}(S)\\subseteq\\mathcal L_U=\\operatorname{Lang}(U)\\)</span>\n(基础语言与扩展语言)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ConservTh}_{\\mathcal L_0}(U,S)\">\\(\\mathrm{ConservTh}_{\\mathcal L_0}(U,S)\\)</span>\n(旧语言保守性, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4a1d989a5f615933\" href=\"?note=4a1d989a5f615933\" title=\"91-df-conservative-truth\">91-df-conservative-truth</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ModelExp}(U/S)\n\\coloneqq\n\\forall\\mathcal M\\in\\operatorname{Mod}(S)\\,\n\\left(\n\\exists\\mathcal M_U\\,\n\\bigl(\n\\mathcal M_U\\upharpoonright\\mathcal L_0=\\mathcal M\n\\land\n\\mathcal M_U\\models U\n\\bigr)\n\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ModelExp}(U/S)\n\\coloneqq\n\\forall\\mathcal M\\in\\operatorname{Mod}(S)\\,\n\\left(\n\\exists\\mathcal M_U\\,\n\\bigl(\n\\mathcal M_U\\upharpoonright\\mathcal L_0=\\mathcal M\n\\land\n\\mathcal M_U\\models U\n\\bigr)\n\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对一阶理论，完备性定理给出</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}conservativity\\text{-}proof}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ModelExp}(U/S)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ConservTh}_{\\mathcal L_0}(U,S).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}conservativity\\text{-}proof}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ModelExp}(U/S)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ConservTh}_{\\mathcal L_0}(U,S).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>模型扩张是常用的充分条件，不是所有保守性证明都必须满足的必要条件。\nTB 与 UTB 可直接为每个 PA 模型选择适当的真理外延，从而应用该判据。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\">\\(\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\\)</span> 的算术保守性也成立，但不能草率声称每个任意非标准\nPA 模型本身都有完整组合满足类；相关模型论证明可能先取适当初等扩张，\n证明论证明则通过消去真理推理完成。含完整\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_T\">\\(\\mathcal L_T\\)</span> 归纳的 CT 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\">\\(\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\\)</span> 必须分开。</p>\n<p>本节点复用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4a1d989a5f615933\" href=\"?note=4a1d989a5f615933\" title=\"91-df-conservative-truth\">91-df-conservative-truth</a> 的\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ConservTh}_{\\mathcal L_0}\">\\(\\mathrm{ConservTh}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\)</span>，不另造同义的保守性谓词。\n证明论方法直接把一个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 对基础句 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 的证明变换成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 证明。\n这两条路线都只建立指定语言上的后果不增加。保守性蕴含：若\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\nvdash\\mathrm{Con}(S)\">\\(S\\nvdash\\mathrm{Con}(S)\\)</span>，则保守的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 也不能证明该基础语言句；\n它不蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}(U)\">\\(S\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}(U)\\)</span>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-conservativity-proof-—-保守性与模型扩张判据-$\\mathrm{ConsProof}$","text":"df-conservativity-proof — 保守性与模型扩张判据 $\\mathrm{ConsProof}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-conservative-truth","status":"resolved","id":"4a1d989a5f615933","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-conservative-truth]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"c8e718c83a9cc331","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-conservative-truth","status":"resolved","id":"4a1d989a5f615933","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ConservTh}_{\\mathcal L_0}(U,S)$\n(旧语言保守性, see [[91-df-conservative-truth]])","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-conservative-truth","status":"resolved","id":"4a1d989a5f615933","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"本节点复用 [[91-df-conservative-truth]] 的\n$\\mathrm{ConservTh}_{\\mathcal L_0}$，不另造同义的保守性谓词。\n证明论方法直接把一个 $U$ 对基础句 $\\varphi$ 的证明变换成 $S$ 证明。\n这两条路线都只建立指定语言上的后果不增加。保守性蕴含：若\n$S\\nvdash\\mathrm{Con}(S)$，则保守的 $U$ 也不能证明该基础语言句；\n它不蕴含 $S\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}(U)$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{ConsProof}","display":false},{"tex":"S\\subseteq U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_0=\\operatorname{Lang}(S)\\subseteq\\mathcal L_U=\\operatorname{Lang}(U)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ConservTh}_{\\mathcal L_0}(U,S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ModelExp}(U/S)\n\\coloneqq\n\\forall\\mathcal M\\in\\operatorname{Mod}(S)\\,\n\\left(\n\\exists\\mathcal M_U\\,\n\\bigl(\n\\mathcal M_U\\upharpoonright\\mathcal L_0=\\mathcal M\n\\land\n\\mathcal M_U\\models U\n\\bigr)\n\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}conservativity\\text{-}proof}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ModelExp}(U/S)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ConservTh}_{\\mathcal L_0}(U,S).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CT}^{-}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CT}^{-}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ConservTh}_{\\mathcal L_0}","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"S\\nvdash\\mathrm{Con}(S)","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"S\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}(U)","display":false}],"bytes":2066,"backlinks":[{"id":"7e76f1ecb9ab7743","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-81","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-conservativity-proof]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-24","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-df-FS-n.md]]\n[[91-df-FS.md]]\n[[91-df-KF-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-KF.md]]\n[[91-df-T-closure.md]]\n[[91-df-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-TB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-TB.md]]\n[[91